// A DS18B20 by ROM id: the declaration parses, lists back as written (all
// eight digits of each half), and its temperature reads through a #field --
// signed, 1/16 degree, little-endian, as the device sends it. The host has no
// bus, so tests/unit/onewire.dat writes the raw value where a reading lands.
#buffer Ute:2 in onewire 0:5 0x28FF641F 0x0716A3C2
#field  UteRaw:16 Ute[0..15]
#variable UteC = 0
UteC = UteRaw * 5 / 8
